Q: I want to pull biological classification information from wikipedia pages A: <p>Getting Domain to work had too many obstacles because it was so seemingly rare in my sample set.</p>
<p>For anyone interested, here are the formulas to make this work (The URL always resides in the E column, with row 2 being the first used cell - therefore $E2):</p>
<p>Kingdom</p>
<pre><code>=IFERROR(
  INDEX(IMPORTXML($E2,&quot;(//table[contains(@class,'infobox')])[1]//tr[*[1][contains(normalize-space(.),'Kingdom')]]/*[2]&quot;),1,1),
  IFERROR(
    INDEX(IMPORTXML($E2,&quot;(//table[contains(@class,'infobox')])[1]//tr[*[1][contains(normalize-space(.),'Kingdom')]]/*[2]&quot;),1,1),
    &quot;&quot;
  )
)
</code></pre>
